            "value": "Mendoza, A. (2024). CCSRE CBR Fellowship Summer 2024 Poster - Systems Navigator Project. Version 1. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/nd142hj1345/version/1. https://doi.org/10.25740/nd142hj1345.",
